<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:23:18Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>APEC深圳峰會：習近平親赴機場迎接特朗普，46年來首次中國元首接機</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjy5xkw9g1zpo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:23:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T13:21:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjy5xkw9g1zpo/trad--ebb64bb62020.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjy5xkw9g1zpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這是中國自1980年以來，首次有最高領導人親赴機場迎接外國元首。1980年前，華國鋒、毛澤東都有多次赴機場迎接外國領袖的歷史。</summary></entry><entry><title>美中俄峰會：為何選在深圳麒麟山莊？習仲勳、金正日都曾下榻</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn0dy4ppxp7o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T08:06:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn0dy4ppxp7o/trad--c152b63dd42c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn0dy4ppxp7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">麒麟山莊離APEC主會場約30分鐘車程，三面環山、一面臨水，封閉性和安保條件都很好。它也與習近平的父親習仲勳有淵源，還接待過已故朝鮮領導人金正日。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳婚外情掀「中國間諜」迷因：幽默與偏見之間，亞裔女性如何自處？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvze7n4gp5rro/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:23:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T12:17:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvze7n4gp5rro/trad--3816d71bcc17.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvze7n4gp5rro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳醜聞曝光後，網上湧現大量「中國間諜」、「美人計」笑話。這些看似無傷大雅的時事迷因，卻讓部分亞裔女性感到困擾。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普訪華之際 美國封堵中國公司在東南亞租用AI算力的「後門」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmpdwn010nyvo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T11:37:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmpdwn010nyvo/trad--b2c509ce1d78.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmpdwn010nyvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在美國限制最先進英偉達芯片直接銷往中國的背景下，中國大型互聯網公司和AI實驗室逐漸轉向「只租算力、不買硬件」的模式。芯片部署在第三國數據中心，中國企業再通過互聯網遠程調用算力訓練模型，而無須把相關硬件運入中國。</summary></entry><entry><title>高雄選戰「知識藍」對決「新潮流」，國民黨能複製「韓流」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T16:25:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad--a43863954373.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">柯志恩以「知識藍」的姿態拉攏中間選民，支持度大幅追貼深耕高雄20年的賴瑞隆，選情咬緊。</summary></entry><entry><title>「藍白合」示範區：新竹市選情如何透露台灣第三勢力的未來？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T09:49:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad--f5d08918cba0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新竹市是民眾黨此前唯一贏得執政權的縣市，現任市長高虹安尋求連任，她這次雖已退出民眾黨、改以無黨籍身分參選，但學者指出其選情不僅將影響雙方未來合作模式能否延續，也可能牽動2028年全國大選的政治布局。</summary></entry><entry><title>九合一前夕：台灣幾乎年年選舉，會引起「投票疲勞」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T10:39:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad--7bd3a1bacef6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣在過去七年間，幾乎每年都有大型選舉、罷免或公投。有學者形容台灣政治人物常處於「選舉模式」，在面對不同議題時往往急於回應。</summary></entry><entry><title>里長赴中旅遊受關注：為何北京鎖定里長？里長怎麼看？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T09:03:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad--590a4fb67825.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣地方選舉即將到來，近年北京對台統戰工作重心從政商菁英轉向基層社會，而里長作為選舉期間的地方「樁腳」，就成為了北京的重要接觸對象。</summary></entry><entry><title>「九合一」五大看點：「洋流」能否撼動台北？誰在卡位2028？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T02:45:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad--4fc64a9bc6d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中共是否介入台灣選舉？ 這次選舉將如何影響賴清德與國民黨主席鄭麗文的政治能量？捲土重來、希望藉著地方議員選舉有所斬獲的小黨，此次結盟能否在主流政黨夾殺中突圍而出？</summary></entry><entry><title>美國今年已10人死於麻疹 26年後失去「麻疹消除狀態」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4jmvxr9vyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:23:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T08:16:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4jmvxr9vyo/trad--0fc497a1d03d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4jmvxr9vyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國時隔26年失去麻疹消除狀態，今年病例達5400例、死亡10人，創1990年代以來新高。「疫苗懷疑論」持續遭到質疑。</summary></entry><entry><title>APEC深圳峰會：賴清德派施振榮出席 台灣參會空間再成焦點</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5y1g89jnnxo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T08:44:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5y1g89jnnxo/trad--cd2391ae108f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5y1g89jnnxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣試圖以企業家身分與科技優勢擴大能見度，中國則以原則框架維持主導權。APEC作為平台，或許能讓雙方同時在場，但仍難以消弭兩岸在全球外交參與的既有分歧。</summary></entry><entry><title>APEC深圳觀察：習近平想告訴世界，中國掌握著未來</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rg46x0ygo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T02:09:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rg46x0ygo/trad--f950e1856ef9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rg46x0ygo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">當世界領導人本週齊聚深圳，他們將看到一座代表中國未來的科技之城：機器人、AI、摩天大樓，處處展現蓬勃的創新活力。但這很可能只是故事的一半：因為峰會停工的建築工人、為生計奔波的零工群體，對未來有著不同的想像。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國以AI奇境接待各國領袖，但他們看不到的另一面是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crgj360lnqv6o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T11:44:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crgj360lnqv6o/trad--e7277c3449b7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crgj360lnqv6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">離開深圳充滿科技感的天際線後，你將會看到習近平治下中國所面臨的種種挑戰。</summary></entry><entry><title>歐盟峰會前夕 貝安德稱英國脫歐「得不償失」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c68x0j2r8lkyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T07:52:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c68x0j2r8lkyo/trad--1cc5e8321ff7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c68x0j2r8lkyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">英國首相在倫敦金融城市長晚宴上向與會人士表示，「我們得到的脫歐結果並沒有奏效」。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄羅斯超級富豪們已經在設想一個「後普京時代」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx27v835864o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T00:34:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx27v835864o/trad--03b72699647d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx27v835864o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些俄羅斯富豪渴望回到90年代的寡頭政治體制，當時商人掌握著權力。</summary></entry><entry><title>里長赴中旅遊：台灣《反滲透法》為何「查辦多、定罪少」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7428z1wx74o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T09:03:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7428z1wx74o/trad--8a4ed0fe3aa1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7428z1wx74o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣「九合一」地方選舉進入倒數，北京試圖介入台灣選舉的相關活動再受關注。台灣《反滲透法》施行後，儘管近年相關案件數量快速增加，但查辦近600人，只有5人被定罪，使現行法律規範與執法標準受到外界檢視。</summary></entry><entry><title>羅伯·派汀森：《暮光之城》男主角如何成為007</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T02:38:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad--03fa8a167e7c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">羅伯·派汀森（Robert Pattinson）早已在《暮光之城》系列、《蝙蝠俠》和《奧德賽》等電影，奠定了自己作為男主角、動作明星及演員的地位。如今，他接下詹姆士·龐德（James Bond；占士邦）一角，將使他的知名度更上一層樓。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國AI之都：「夢想之城」深圳背後的兩個世界</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm7826g36xe5o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T09:33:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm7826g36xe5o/trad--ed571bd562bd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm7826g36xe5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">深圳被譽為中國最具未來感的城市之一。在本週的APEC峰會，中國國家主席習近平將在這裡接待包括美國總統特朗普和俄羅斯總統普京在內的多國領袖，向他們展示這座中國的人工智慧之都。但這座城市還有另一面，是領袖們看不到的。</summary></entry><entry><title>無法複製的奇蹟？深圳如何從改革開放樣板變為「中國矽谷」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46q2nl5n2o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-15T18:21:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46q2nl5n2o/trad--626e71e48e28.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46q2nl5n2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">深圳首次主辦亞太經濟合作組織（APEC）領導人峰會，成為中國的第三座主辦城市。深圳的崛起往往被視為中國改革開放最成功的一場實驗。而在中國和世界變幻莫測的今天，這個高速發展的奇蹟還能延續嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣村里長：最基層的民選公職，如何牽動選舉動員與兩岸關係？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kg7mdzj12no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-15T04:28:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kg7mdzj12no/trad--f531762e90e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kg7mdzj12no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">村里長是台灣最基層的民選公職，因為掌握地方人脈，在社區服務與選舉動員中扮演重要角色。近年部分里長赴中國交流，引發北京透過基層網絡影響台灣政治的疑慮。BBC中文走訪台灣多個縣市，訪問三位不同世代、不同政治背景的里長，探討地方政治、兩岸交流與統戰之間的界線。</summary></entry><entry><title>「台灣之光」形象重挫？民眾如何看黃仁勳婚外情風波</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0ey0qx7yo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T04:28:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0ey0qx7yo/trad--897367f353c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0ey0qx7yo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">輝達（英偉達）執行長黃仁勳捲入婚外情風波，部分美國媒體引述情報官員指，涉事女子與中國情報系統有關。BBC中文在台北街頭採訪民眾，了解他們如何看待這場仍在持續發醇的風波。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉掀「藍色浪潮」 將怎樣影響世界</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c5vgjjr77wvxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T14:58:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c5vgjjr77wvxo/trad--77bba52040c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c5vgjjr77wvxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在剛剛結束的美國中期選舉中，多個支持共和黨的州「翻藍」，民主黨奪得國會參眾兩院控制權。這次選舉結果為何具有重大意義？又將如何影響美國與世界其他國家的關係？</summary></entry><entry><title>「讓黃仁勳回歸」運動：輝達駁斥、特朗普支持恢復其CEO職位</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rgq3l5yr1o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T07:20:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rgq3l5yr1o/trad--b27dc602b96e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rgq3l5yr1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">多位科技業領袖表態支持一項行動，要求這家AI晶片龍頭讓黃仁勳重返執行長職位。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國人如何背棄特朗普——2026中期大選結果覆盤</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f#4</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T00:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f--393d86e5dbaa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">九張圖表解釋民主黨在美國中期選舉中的壓倒性勝利，以及這對總統意味著甚麼。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳曾告訴我，那些關於中國與國家安全的問題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T02:41:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad--d34e970c53e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳正因涉嫌與一名中國間諜出軌而接受調查，他對世界秩序的未來遠比其他科技巨頭老闆重要得多。</summary></entry><entry><title>普京提議中美俄「三方會談」：特朗普響應，北京未表態，基輔反對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T08:40:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad--076620887441.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在普京建議三方於APEC期間進行會談後，特朗普表示願意參與，強調會談重點將是無核化問題。目前中方尚未就三方會談表態。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>「台灣乾爹」光環崩塌：黃仁勳事件如何震動產業、政治與社會？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T09:51:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad--d4f113586173.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳光速跌落神壇的事件，讓台灣社會對他的崇拜、政治對他的政績綁定，以及產業對他個人的依賴重新校準。</summary></entry><entry><title>「中國間諜案」獲撤控男子BBC專訪：我是情報部門的替罪羊</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9d71qne5p9o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T13:43:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9d71qne5p9o/trad--37d4f7a5dd1d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9d71qne5p9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC取得並查閱的數千則訊息顯示，一名中國官員曾設法了解多項敏感政治事務的內情。</summary></entry><entry><title>從科技巨星到跌落神壇——黃仁勳如何深陷醜聞漩渦？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3wgp60p952o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T16:14:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3wgp60p952o/trad--8060ccd97f8e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3wgp60p952o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">短短幾天內，黃仁勳作為全球科技競賽領軍人物、看似無可撼動的地位便迅速崩塌。</summary></entry><entry><title>從局長下台到議會「沉默」 宏福苑大火後的政治問責與維穩邏輯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T01:03:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad--126982746c97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC中文採訪多名政治分析人士，拆解這場善後操作背後所反映的維穩管治邏輯，以及又與即將舉行的選委會及特首選舉有何深層連結。</summary></entry><entry><title>全球最大排放國的拐點：中國煤電佔比跌破五成，碳排放幾乎停滯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxnv0vgpj0qpo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T10:09:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxnv0vgpj0qpo/trad--95892e97c1d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxnv0vgpj0qpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">分析指排放或已提前達峰，但新煤電機組仍大量上馬，拐點成色有待檢驗。</summary></entry><entry><title>BBC調查揭英國「全球人才簽證」造假產業：中介助移民冒充藝術家及科技專才</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw4gn0mgz1m3o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T08:27:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw4gn0mgz1m3o/trad--04598e34d87a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw4gn0mgz1m3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC臥底調查揭露一場精心策劃的騙局，協助富裕移民透過快速通道取得英國永久居留權。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美能源大戰，如何影響你的帳單？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T01:45:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad--bf8b484b78f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中美之間的博弈可能會對能源成本產生重大影響，但誰會最終獲勝？</summary></entry><entry><title>從蔡康永、《VIVANT》到姆巴佩，北京為何區別處理「辱華」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T00:21:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad--c99d6f3ad72f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">最近幾週，中國輿論場接連出現多宗被貼上「辱華」標籤的爭議事件：台灣藝人蔡康永、日本電視劇《VIVANT》以及法國球星姆巴佩。三宗事件看似性質相近，但官方反應與輿論熱度卻明顯不同，多位分析人士對BBC中文指出：這些差異背後是當局對於每個事件的定性並不相同。</summary></entry><entry><title>美智庫解析「技術民族主義」下的中俄軍工合作細節與限度</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T00:23:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad--3886ce690971.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">深圳APEC前夕，中俄「無上限」合有任何挑戰嗎？北京對烏克蘭停火興趣如何？在APEC中美俄三方領袖會面能有所突破？</summary></entry><entry><title>為什麼歐洲各國年輕人走上街頭？背後的共同訴求和暴力隱憂</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T03:52:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad--af7f5220a503.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">過去一個月，歐洲各地爆發了由青年主導的示威遊行。這些遊行活動有何共同點？</summary></entry><entry><title>身體最常受傷、卻很少人會刻意鍛鍊的部位：腳踝</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T00:29:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad--c5f5a8d6cf18.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">運動物理治療師珍妮薇芙·陶亞（Genevieve Tawiah）分享了她護理關節的秘訣；關節問題佔急診就診量的 5%。</summary></entry><entry><title>「你甚至不會告訴密友」：分娩後遺症，為何多年後仍揮之不去？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T08:33:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad--b1eb3b049467.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從失禁到長期疼痛，數以百萬計的女性在分娩數十年後仍然飽受後遺症困擾。</summary></entry><entry><title>父母選擇「雙人安樂死」，留下我獨自承受喪親之痛</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T06:32:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad--0dd0092810ad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">簡和埃爾斯在幸福地生活了50年後，選擇接受安樂死，留下了他們唯一的孩子。</summary></entry><entry><title>認識史蒂芬妮·凱斯——首位在南極洲跑完100英里的女性</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46yzz5vrxo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T10:22:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46yzz5vrxo/trad--1779fa75d6a4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46yzz5vrxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">史蒂芬妮·凱斯創造了歷史，成為第一個完成南極洲100英里極限賽的女性。</summary></entry><entry><title>「短睡眠基因」：為何有人只需睡四小時？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T02:59:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad--f832ffff66be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一般成年人平均需要七至九小時睡眠，但有些人確實只需極少睡眠也能維持良好狀態。</summary></entry></feed>
